{"id": "t064-001", "text": "Coffee with Grace after work. Her interview at the council is Thursday and she's properly nervous, hasn't slept much. Her husband Luca is cooking her a big dinner the night before. Text her good luck that morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Grace", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after work"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the council", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "properly nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t064-003", "text": "Long catch-up with Tariq. He's got really into bouldering, goes three times a week now and is eyeing up a trip to Fontainebleau. Still at the bank but applying for a data analyst job at the NHS trust, closing date 14 November 2026.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tariq", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three times a week"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "eyeing up a trip to Fontainebleau", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the bank", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "data analyst job at the NHS trust", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t064-004", "text": "Called Leah. Her parents' 40th anniversary is on 2 November 2026 and she's organising a surprise lunch. Need to send her the photos from their ruby wedding thing years ago. Her brother Oscar is doing the speech, God help us.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "40th anniversary", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise lunch", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her the photos from their ruby wedding thing years ago", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ruby wedding", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "years ago", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oscar", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t064-005", "text": "Ruby's knitting obsession continues - she's on her fourth jumper this year and has started selling baby cardigans on Etsy. Her girlfriend Alina says the spare room is just wool now.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ruby", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "knitting", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "selling baby cardigans on Etsy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alina", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t064-010", "text": "Emre got the job!! Starts at the agency in January 2027. Was so worried after the presentation round but they offered it the next morning. Send congrats and maybe a bottle of something.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emre", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got the job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Starts at the agency", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the presentation round"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send congrats and maybe a bottle of something", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t064-014", "text": "Chatted with Dmitri at the pub quiz. He's started a chess club at the library on Tuesdays and is trying to get rated. Lena, his wife, is learning Russian so she can talk to his gran properly.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dmitri", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "chess club at the library", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesdays"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to get rated", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lena", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "learning Russian", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gran", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t064-015", "text": "Oscar and Mariam had their engagement party Saturday, lovely evening. Mariam's dad cried in his speech. They're thinking spring 2028 for the wedding because her brother's getting married first, in August 2027.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oscar", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mariam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mariam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "spring 2028", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in August 2027", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t064-016", "text": "Khadija applied for the head of year role at her school. Interview is on the 21st, and they want her to teach a lesson that morning before the panel. She's a bit stressed about the lesson more than the interview tbh. Remind me to message her afterwards to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "head of year role at her school", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 21st", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lesson", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning before the panel", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t064-018", "text": "Bruno's dog Pepper had an operation on her leg on Monday. She's home now but has to wear the cone for two weeks. Bruno's been sleeping on the sofa downstairs with her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation on her leg", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t064-020", "text": "Duc mentioned he's doing a pottery course on Wednesday evenings, wheel throwing. Made a very wonky mug. Loves it though.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pottery course", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday evenings"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "wheel throwing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Loves it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t064-022", "text": "Ines got engaged to her partner Luca last night, they're over the moon. Don't forget to send a card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got engaged", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t064-023", "text": "Grace and her husband are off to Edinburgh for their anniversary next weekend. Their cat Biscuit is going to Grace's sister. She's been fretting about leaving him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Grace", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Edinburgh", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Grace", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fretting about leaving him", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t064-027", "text": "Leah's sister Georgia had her hen do in Brighton at the weekend, sounded chaotic. The wedding's 15 November. Leah's a bridesmaid and has to give a reading, she's dreading it. Text Leah the day before to say she'll smash it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Georgia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hen do in Brighton", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 November", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "reading", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text Leah", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t064-030", "text": "Keisha has an interview with the BBC for a researcher role, first round is a video call on Monday 10th and if she gets through the in-person is a week after. She's so excited, been wanting to work there since uni. Her flatmate Emre is helping her prep.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview with the BBC for a researcher role", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "video call", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday 10th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "in-person", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week after", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting to work there", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "since uni"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emre", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t064-033", "text": "Lena's been doing the parkrun every Saturday for a year. Just did her 50th, got the t-shirt. Training for the half marathon in Cardiff in October 2027. Dmitri goes to cheer her on but refuses to run.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "parkrun", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every Saturday"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a year"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "50th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "half marathon in Cardiff", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in October 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dmitri", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "refuses to run", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t064-034", "text": "Reggie phoned about the job at the garage, he didn't get it. Said they went with someone with more experience. He's alright about it, already applying elsewhere. Remind me to send him that apprentice listing I saw.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reggie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at the garage", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "alright", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him that apprentice listing I saw", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t064-037", "text": "Lovely chat with Oscar. He's started playing bass in a covers band with some guys from work, first gig is at the Red Lion on 6 December. He's bricking it. Must go, and tell Sunil and Bruno too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oscar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "playing bass in a covers band", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first gig", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6 December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "bricking it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "go", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "tell Sunil and Bruno", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sunil", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t064-038", "text": "Sunil's parents are renewing their vows for their 50th in Goa, January 2027. He's flying out on the 2nd. His mum has picked out matching outfits for the whole family which he's not thrilled about.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sunil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "renewing their vows", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "50th", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "January 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not thrilled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t064-039", "text": "Mohammed's interview for the teaching assistant job is this Friday morning. He's more relaxed than I expected. His wife Fatima did the same job for years. Ring him on Friday evening to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview for the teaching assistant job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this Friday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relaxed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fatima", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "years"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t064-041", "text": "Yetunde reads about two books a week. Into crime fiction at the moment, Scandi stuff, Jo Nesbo etc. Wants the new Ann Cleeves for Christmas apparently.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "reads about two books a week", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "crime fiction", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Scandi stuff", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i4", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Jo Nesbo", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wants the new Ann Cleeves", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas"}]}
{"id": "t064-042", "text": "Bruno's 30th wedding anniversary was on Sunday. I forgot. Need to send a card, even if it's late.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "30th wedding anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t064-043", "text": "Mrs Lopez next door says her grandson got into the Royal Academy of Music. Starts in September 2027. Plays the cello. She's so proud.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Lopez", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandson", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the Royal Academy of Music", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Starts", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "cello", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t064-044", "text": "Ines has her final interview at the law firm on Wednesday. There's a written test in the morning and then the partner interview afterwards. Her dad's a lawyer there, which she says makes it worse. Text her on Wednesday night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "final interview at the law firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "written test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "partner interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lawyer", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t064-046", "text": "Gintaras and his wife Lena are moving to Manchester in March 2027 because she's got a new job there, consultant post. He's going to look for work once they're settled. Their twins start school there in September.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gintaras", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lena", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Manchester", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "consultant post", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "once they're settled", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "school", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t064-048", "text": "Tariq said his grandad, Grandpa Ali, passed away last Tuesday. Funeral's on Friday in Birmingham. He's taking a few days off work. I should drop round some food on the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tariq", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Grandpa Ali", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking a few days off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round some food", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t064-049", "text": "Angela and Stefan are hosting Christmas this year for both families, sixteen people. She is stressed. Her mum is vegan now which adds another layer.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hosting Christmas", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t064-050", "text": "Chatted to Luca about his interview prep. He's going for a senior dev role at a fintech, technical test on the 4th, then a system design round the day after. Says he hasn't done a whiteboard interview in years. Wants me to do a mock one with him on Sunday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "senior dev role at a fintech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "technical test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 4th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "system design round", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in years"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday"}]}
{"id": "t064-058", "text": "Called Aneesh. His wedding to Khadija is all booked, 2 November 2026, the registry office then a curry house. His stag was meant to be in Amsterdam but they called it off, doing golf in Surrey instead. Their dog Bhaji is going to be the ring bearer. I need to sort the gift list thing, they've put a honeymoon fund on it. Ask Mohammed if he's going to the stag.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "golf in Surrey", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Bhaji", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort the gift list thing", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "honeymoon fund", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Mohammed if he's going to the stag", "owner": "p3", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t064-059", "text": "Dmitri is retiring from the council at Christmas after 30 years. Leaving drinks on 18 December. He's not sure what to do with himself, keeps talking about getting an allotment.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dmitri", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring from the council", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after 30 years"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "18 December", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sure what to do with himself", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "keeps talking about getting an allotment", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
